1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Seventh Episode
The Magic Tree

15
00:01:53,021 --> 00:01:55,899
Ladies and gentlemen,
today we present to you...

16
00:01:55,941 --> 00:01:58,739
...the second part
of "Mephisto's Spell"

17
00:01:59,341 --> 00:02:01,616
We remind you what happened
in the first part,

18
00:02:01,661 --> 00:02:03,891
presented
in the previous episode.

19
00:02:03,941 --> 00:02:07,411
Hell, Hecate's mother,
turns Sapphire into a doll,

20
00:02:07,461 --> 00:02:10,339
commanding her to go
towards Mephisto's cave.

21
00:02:10,741 --> 00:02:13,619
Meanwhile Hecate, who refused
to become a witch,

22
00:02:13,661 --> 00:02:17,017
runs away from home.
On the road she meets Sapphire.

23
00:02:17,061 --> 00:02:19,017
...and takes her
to the kingdom of Goldland,

24
00:02:19,061 --> 00:02:22,178
where Prince Franz lives,
Sapphire's best friend.

25
00:02:22,461 --> 00:02:25,100
The Prince,
willing to give refuge to Sapphire,

26
00:02:25,141 --> 00:02:27,496
notices that the girl
he is infatuated with...

27
00:02:27,541 --> 00:02:31,580
...is, in reality, Sapphire herself
and decides to protect her from Mephisto.

28
00:02:32,501 --> 00:02:36,414
But the evil Hell tracks down
Sapphire at Goldland castle...

29
00:02:36,461 --> 00:02:40,340
...and, to take her back, turns
the inhabitants of the castle into stone.

30
00:02:40,621 --> 00:02:44,170
The Prince fights with Hell
and with Mephisto, risking his life,

31
00:02:44,261 --> 00:02:47,219
but Hell defeats him
and takes Sapphire away.

32
00:02:48,621 --> 00:02:50,373
Sapphire!

33
00:03:04,661 --> 00:03:06,538
Poor Franz...!

34
00:03:10,461 --> 00:03:13,737
Don't be so sad,
Prince Franz!

35
00:03:17,781 --> 00:03:22,332
Kitty, you speak! Don't fear, I
won't reveal your secret to anyone.

36
00:03:22,381 --> 00:03:26,090
- You understand my pain, don't you?
- Yes, I understand it.

37
00:03:26,541 --> 00:03:29,180
Oh, if only I could have
my Sapphire back!

38
00:03:30,621 --> 00:03:34,899
Sapphire! Sapphire! Sapphire!

39
00:03:37,221 --> 00:03:39,098
Sapphire!

40
00:03:39,661 --> 00:03:42,016
Damned Mephisto,
don't be so cruel!

41
00:03:42,061 --> 00:03:45,815
Give me back my Sapphire! I offer
you my life in exchange for hers!

42
00:03:46,781 --> 00:03:49,773
Prince Franz,
I know where Sapphire is.

43
00:03:49,821 --> 00:03:51,891
What? You know where she is? Tell me!

44
00:03:51,941 --> 00:03:53,897
I don't know if I'm doing
the right thing by telling you.

45
00:03:53,941 --> 00:03:57,138
But you must tell me! Please,
tell me right now where she is! Please!

46
00:03:57,181 --> 00:03:59,775
Wait a moment,
I'm going to check!

47
00:04:02,101 --> 00:04:04,057
Oh, what should I do?!

48
00:04:04,101 --> 00:04:07,173
Mom and Dad must have
certainly taken her to the cave!

49
00:04:07,261 --> 00:04:10,333
What would they say if I brought
Prince Franz down there?

50
00:04:10,381 --> 00:04:14,169
I don't care if they scold me,
but they might treat him badly...

51
00:04:14,221 --> 00:04:16,451
.and I really don't like that!

52
00:04:16,661 --> 00:04:21,132
Oh, what a huge problem! But I have to
solve it one way or another.

53
00:04:21,781 --> 00:04:23,612
So, kitty, did you check?

54
00:04:23,661 --> 00:04:25,811
Did you see which direction
they took? Quick, tell me!

55
00:04:25,861 --> 00:04:28,250
Yes, I saw that they went
that way.

56
00:04:32,821 --> 00:04:35,096
Here I am, Sapphire! I'm coming!

57
00:04:37,181 --> 00:04:40,412
What a situation I've gotten myself into!
How will it end?

58
00:05:02,421 --> 00:05:05,458
Prince Franz,
all I can do is trust in you.

59
00:05:07,021 --> 00:05:10,900
Oh, I'm so annoyed!
Where has Hecate gone?

60
00:05:10,941 --> 00:05:13,819
Try consulting
your crystal ball.

61
00:05:13,861 --> 00:05:16,250
We're reduced to consulting
the crystal ball...

62
00:05:16,301 --> 00:05:18,212
..to know where our daughter is,

63
00:05:18,261 --> 00:05:20,411
who goes out without even
telling her parents!

64
00:05:20,461 --> 00:05:23,658
Here are the consequences of
the upbringing that you gave her!

65
00:05:23,701 --> 00:05:26,090
Don't be so shrewish, my dear!

66
00:05:26,141 --> 00:05:29,213
Maybe she isn't coming back precisely so
she doesn't have to hear your grumbling!

67
00:05:29,261 --> 00:05:31,331
Shut up! Don't talk nonsense!

68
00:05:31,381 --> 00:05:34,179
And look: the crystal
ball is blackened!

69
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:39,453
You're so lazy that you don't
even take care of your things!

70
00:05:39,501 --> 00:05:41,935
Now clean it, if you
want to use it! Go on!

71
00:05:47,421 --> 00:05:51,414
Today I feel depressed! Who
wouldn't be with a wife like that?

72
00:05:51,461 --> 00:05:54,737
Stop complaining, you
lazybones! And keep polishing!

73
00:05:55,141 --> 00:05:57,291
Franz won't be able to find me.

74
00:05:57,341 --> 00:06:00,333
When Hecate returns home,
Mephisto will not waste time...

75
00:06:00,381 --> 00:06:02,815
...and will immediately
exchange my heart with hers.

76
00:06:03,101 --> 00:06:05,331
I must escape before she returns.

77
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:27,299
How strange... I feel like I've
already passed through here.

78
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,532
Are you making me go in circles, kitty?

79
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:31,458
Tell the truth: do you really
know where Sapphire is?

80
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:34,572
- Yes, I know!
- Then tell me exactly where she is.

81
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:37,135
Well, look, she should
be... She's over there!

82
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:40,619
You say she's locked in
that house? Let's go see!

83
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:42,573
Sapphire!

84
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:53,092
Sapphire, where are
you? It is I: Prince Franz!

85
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:58,129
Perhaps it's Mephisto who's
preventing her from answering.

86
00:06:58,180 --> 00:07:01,890
I'll find her anyway!
Maybe she's here! Or here!

87
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,492
Forgive me, Franz.

88
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:08,931
You told me a lie, kitty.

89
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:11,776
Sapphire is not in this house!

90
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:21,613
Forgive me, Franz, I didn't
mean to deceive you! I'm not a liar!

91
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:27,850
It's just that I felt so
sorry for you, so I...

92
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:31,656
Ah, well! Finally you have revealed
yourself for what you are, kitty!

93
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:34,169
- You're an agent of Mephisto, right?
- Oh, no!

94
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:36,132
Mephisto, don't mock me!

95
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:38,411
Take my life
in exchange for Sapphire's!

96
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:43,017
I would like to help him, but
how can I do it? I have an idea!

97
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:46,294
Hail Mephisto!

98
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:54,419
- Show yourself, Mephisto! Show yourself!
- Prince Franz!

99
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:57,018
Sapphire, is it you?

100
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:59,855
Yes, Franz! I
managed to escape!

101
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:05,093
Oh, Sapphire! How
happy I am to see you!

102
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:10,699
How wicked I am...
I am deceiving him!

103
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:14,537
But how I wish he would
see me as Sapphire!

104
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:17,894
Sapphire, why is there
that tear on your face?

105
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:22,012
Wait! Don't go away!

106
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:24,291
Sapphire, what is happening
to you? Wait for me!

107
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:30,009
Forgive me, Prince
Franz, I beg you!

108
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:33,895
I am not Sapphire! In reality, I
am Hecate, the daughter of Mephisto!

109
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:43,938
It was always me,
even that little kitten.

110
00:08:44,180 --> 00:08:47,139
If you are really the daughter of
Mephisto, what do you want from me?

111
00:08:47,221 --> 00:08:49,815
You were so sad that
I tried to comfort you...

112
00:08:49,861 --> 00:08:53,649
by taking on the appearance of
Sapphire. I beg you, Prince, forgive me!

113
00:08:54,901 --> 00:08:58,814
Forgive you?! How can I forgive
you? You were only mocking me!

114
00:08:59,181 --> 00:09:02,537
Only a diabolical soul
could devise such a trick!

115
00:09:02,901 --> 00:09:07,292
Oh, no! How I wish I
wasn't the daughter of Mephisto!

116
00:09:17,421 --> 00:09:19,651
There, now it’s nice and shiny!

117
00:09:19,701 --> 00:09:22,534
- Look how marvelous, dear!
- Let me see!

118
00:09:25,101 --> 00:09:28,730
- Sapphire has escaped!
- What are you saying?!

119
00:09:31,221 --> 00:09:35,339
Damn! She escaped while I was polishing the sphere!

120
00:09:35,701 --> 00:09:38,010
You're a real idiot!

121
00:09:38,061 --> 00:09:40,017
One more effort...

122
00:09:46,141 --> 00:09:49,895
You can't escape! Now I'll catch you again and take you back to your cell!

123
00:09:49,941 --> 00:09:52,375
- And make sure you don't escape again!
- No!

124
00:09:57,661 --> 00:10:00,539
Well then, Sapphire!
You wanted to escape, eh?

125
00:10:01,301 --> 00:10:03,292
Hail Mephisto!

126
00:10:15,821 --> 00:10:17,891
This way she won't escape!

127
00:10:18,101 --> 00:10:20,854
Leave me alone! You bastard!

128
00:10:20,901 --> 00:10:23,017
- You bastard!
- It's no use resisting!

129
00:10:24,261 --> 00:10:25,899
No!

130
00:10:27,661 --> 00:10:30,892
Dammit!
I'll have to polish it again!

131
00:10:38,821 --> 00:10:41,938
Hecate!
I'm sorry for what I said.

132
00:10:41,981 --> 00:10:44,449
Now I understand that, after all,
you wanted to help me.

133
00:10:44,901 --> 00:10:48,610
You disguised yourself as Sapphire with good
intentions, to bring me comfort.

134
00:10:49,341 --> 00:10:52,572
Prince, I believe there is
only one way to save her.

135
00:10:52,621 --> 00:10:54,293
Really? And what would it be?

136
00:10:54,341 --> 00:10:56,616
I know that it was
my parents who kidnapped her,

137
00:10:56,661 --> 00:10:59,733
so she must be
locked up in our house.

138
00:11:00,381 --> 00:11:02,576
Then tell me:
where is your house located?

139
00:11:02,621 --> 00:11:05,010
No, wait!
No matter how strong you are,

140
00:11:05,061 --> 00:11:07,370
you can never hope
to surpass my parents!

141
00:11:07,421 --> 00:11:09,013
- But...
- But?

142
00:11:09,061 --> 00:11:11,291
If you blinded them,
you might succeed.

143
00:11:11,341 --> 00:11:13,809
What? Blind your parents?!

144
00:11:13,861 --> 00:11:15,738
But only for a short time.

145
00:11:15,781 --> 00:11:18,090
At the top of the Mountain of Ghosts
there is a tree:

146
00:11:18,141 --> 00:11:21,178
they say its sap makes
anyone who drinks it lose their sight.

147
00:11:21,661 --> 00:11:23,572
The Mountain of Ghosts?

148
00:11:42,021 --> 00:11:43,898
What's the matter, Hecate?

149
00:11:44,301 --> 00:11:46,019
Hail Mephisto!

150
00:11:47,101 --> 00:11:49,251
Kitty! Presto!

151
00:11:53,421 --> 00:11:55,616
Why have you transformed yourself, Hecate?

152
00:11:56,661 --> 00:11:59,494
Mom and Dad are looking for me
with the magic sphere,

153
00:11:59,541 --> 00:12:02,055
so I created a double of myself
to escape them.

154
00:12:02,101 --> 00:12:05,252
I'll make her walk through the woods,
so they'll think I'm still here.

155
00:12:05,301 --> 00:12:07,371
Little sister, walk while singing!

156
00:12:07,421 --> 00:12:14,133
There is a Prince I love
and he doesn't know it yet...

157
00:12:19,781 --> 00:12:24,013
But it's Hecate!
Darling, I found where Hecate is!

158
00:12:26,061 --> 00:12:29,576
Damn, they found her!
Then it's over for me!

159
00:12:29,621 --> 00:12:32,613
She's in the woods, at the foot
of Ghost Mountain

160
00:12:32,661 --> 00:12:35,698
What are you waiting for?!
Move, go there immediately!

161
00:12:36,181 --> 00:12:38,411
Alright, alright! I'm running!

162
00:12:39,581 --> 00:12:43,130
And don't come back if you
haven't found her, damn the devil!

163
00:12:44,181 --> 00:12:47,093
Excuse me, usually
I'm not so vulgar!

164
00:12:57,701 --> 00:13:05,016
The Prince is far away, he
doesn't realize that I love him.

165
00:13:05,421 --> 00:13:08,811
- The Prince is far away...
- Hecate!

166
00:13:08,861 --> 00:13:12,774
Why did you go away! Your
mother is furious, you know? Now...

167
00:13:14,181 --> 00:13:16,490
But then it was just an image!

168
00:13:18,101 --> 00:13:21,411
Hecate! Can I know
where you've gotten to?

169
00:13:32,741 --> 00:13:35,016
Here is the tree
of the evil spirit!

170
00:13:35,061 --> 00:13:37,859
My mother told me that
whoever touches it is cursed.

171
00:13:37,901 --> 00:13:40,210
But there's nothing else
to be done, unfortunately!

172
00:13:43,181 --> 00:13:47,220
Stay here, Prince
Franz! I will go on alone.

173
00:13:48,541 --> 00:13:50,293
Be careful, Hecate!

174
00:13:53,581 --> 00:13:55,333
Hail Mephisto!

175
00:14:31,901 --> 00:14:34,654
You are in danger, Hecate!
Go back!

176
00:14:35,021 --> 00:14:39,378
The evil spirit is angry,
but I must do it anyway!

177
00:14:44,021 --> 00:14:46,057
Damn it, take this!

178
00:14:48,061 --> 00:14:51,531
Quick, Hecate, come
back here! It will hurt you!

179
00:15:14,141 --> 00:15:15,893
There!

180
00:15:20,141 --> 00:15:21,813
You did it!

181
00:15:21,861 --> 00:15:23,817
This sap is enough
for what I have in mind.

182
00:15:23,861 --> 00:15:25,738
Now we must go back.

183
00:15:42,101 --> 00:15:45,411
- Hecate, what's wrong?
- I feel terrible!

184
00:15:45,701 --> 00:15:48,773
I have the evil spirit's curse
upon me!

185
00:15:53,141 --> 00:15:56,690
Hecate, you knew about the curse
and you wanted to go anyway.

186
00:15:57,021 --> 00:15:59,137
Now don't worry about me!

187
00:15:59,181 --> 00:16:02,571
If my parents find you, you won't
be able to save Sapphire anymore!

188
00:16:02,661 --> 00:16:05,095
We must hurry,
so follow me!

189
00:16:05,821 --> 00:16:07,618
Hecate!

190
00:16:25,261 --> 00:16:27,729
Now, Franz,
don't move from there...

191
00:16:27,781 --> 00:16:30,818
...until I give you a signal.
- All right.

192
00:16:35,381 --> 00:16:37,815
Where on earth could Hecate have gone?

193
00:16:37,861 --> 00:16:40,170
I'm so worried about her!

194
00:16:41,781 --> 00:16:43,817
- Papa!
- Hecate!

195
00:16:43,861 --> 00:16:47,410
You're finally back home!
My little girl!

196
00:16:47,701 --> 00:16:50,499
Darling, Hecate is here! She's back!

197
00:16:51,021 --> 00:16:53,296
Finally, some good news!

198
00:16:55,021 --> 00:16:58,297
Hecate, my child! Where have you
been? We've been so worried about you!

199
00:16:58,341 --> 00:17:01,538
Don't scold her, dear! Ever since
she returned, she seems very unwell!

200
00:17:01,581 --> 00:17:05,096
She's unwell? She has a guilty conscience
for having made us suffer so much!

201
00:17:05,141 --> 00:17:07,018
But now we will perform
the operation immediately...

202
00:17:07,061 --> 00:17:09,177
...to swap her heart with Sapphire's.

203
00:17:09,221 --> 00:17:11,451
- Isn't it better to wait?
- No!

204
00:17:11,581 --> 00:17:15,290
If the operation must be done,
it's better that it's done right away.

205
00:17:15,381 --> 00:17:18,373
Hail Mephisto!

206
00:17:19,021 --> 00:17:21,489
Good, now have Sapphire brought here!

207
00:17:22,261 --> 00:17:25,173
Hail Mephisto!

208
00:17:25,661 --> 00:17:29,370
- Help! Help, Franz! Help!
- But that's Sapphire's voice!

209
00:17:30,101 --> 00:17:32,012
Franz, help me!

210
00:17:32,061 --> 00:17:35,019
Hold on, Sapphire! I have
to wait for Hecate's signal.

211
00:17:41,621 --> 00:17:46,092
What are you waiting for, my
daughter? Lie down here, next to Sapphire.

212
00:17:46,861 --> 00:17:50,092
Has the moment arrived when
I will become a great witch?

213
00:17:50,141 --> 00:17:51,893
Of course, my daughter!

214
00:17:52,221 --> 00:17:54,689
Even if you're feeling sick, don't worry.

215
00:17:54,741 --> 00:17:57,733
Afterward, you'll be able
to recover from any illness.

216
00:17:57,781 --> 00:18:00,341
I think I'll become much
more capable than I am now.

217
00:18:00,381 --> 00:18:03,134
- Do you want to toast to this?
- Certainly, Hecate!

218
00:18:03,381 --> 00:18:05,497
Hail Mephisto!

219
00:18:11,661 --> 00:18:14,573
I don't feel well...
Mother, can I ask you a favor?

220
00:18:14,621 --> 00:18:17,294
Tell me what you want, little one,
and don't worry.

221
00:18:17,341 --> 00:18:19,457
Soon you will feel much better.

222
00:18:19,501 --> 00:18:23,130
I've heard that decent people
never fail to make a toast

223
00:18:23,181 --> 00:18:25,649
when they are about to celebrate
something.

224
00:18:25,701 --> 00:18:28,773
"Decent people"?! You want me
to make a toast? But of course!

225
00:18:28,821 --> 00:18:30,573
Give me a glass, dear!

226
00:18:31,861 --> 00:18:34,295
- To the birth of a
great witch! - Cheers!

227
00:18:35,901 --> 00:18:38,176
Forgive me, mother and father...

228
00:18:43,461 --> 00:18:46,612
What's happening?
I can hardly see anymore!

229
00:18:47,261 --> 00:18:50,617
Franz, come here! Franz!

230
00:18:52,461 --> 00:18:55,498
Hecate, why on earth are you calling Franz?!

231
00:18:55,541 --> 00:18:58,214
Where are you, Hecate?
What the hell are you doing?

232
00:18:58,421 --> 00:19:01,413
- Franz! - There's the signal!
Hecate is calling me!

233
00:19:07,301 --> 00:19:10,259
- Franz, hurry up!
- What's happening?

234
00:19:10,301 --> 00:19:13,532
Could Prince Franz have come
to take Sapphire back?!

235
00:19:13,581 --> 00:19:16,937
- Dammit, I can't see anything!
- Sapphire! Sapphire, wake up!

236
00:19:18,221 --> 00:19:20,655
Hurry up! Escape, quickly!

237
00:19:20,701 --> 00:19:23,420
Hecate, you saved me! I will
be forever grateful to you!

238
00:19:23,701 --> 00:19:26,818
Hecate, you dared to betray
your parents?!

239
00:19:26,861 --> 00:19:30,297
I have already received
punishment from the evil spirit.

240
00:19:31,781 --> 00:19:35,057
- What?!
- Yes, perhaps I will die for this.

241
00:19:35,341 --> 00:19:38,777
Flee with us, Hecate! I can't
bear the thought of you dying!

242
00:19:39,461 --> 00:19:43,340
What do I hear! Hecate is
dying?! No, for heaven's sake! No!

243
00:19:43,901 --> 00:19:46,131
Quick, Sapphire, let's take her away!

244
00:19:46,541 --> 00:19:49,374
Stop! I won't let you escape!

245
00:19:52,701 --> 00:19:56,660
If only I could see
where they are! Damn it!

246
00:20:00,341 --> 00:20:03,697
Devil of a woman! She
hit me instead of them!

247
00:20:04,021 --> 00:20:06,774
We must try to get through
at all costs, Sapphire!

248
00:20:08,381 --> 00:20:11,339
Run, Sapphire!
Follow me or they'll catch us!

249
00:20:11,381 --> 00:20:13,212
I'm following you, Franz!

250
00:20:13,581 --> 00:20:16,414
Catch them! Catch them!

251
00:20:16,461 --> 00:20:18,656
Damn you!
Get out of the way!

252
00:20:22,701 --> 00:20:25,613
- Hecate!
- My daughter!

253
00:20:39,101 --> 00:20:41,012
Courage, Hecate!

254
00:21:06,541 --> 00:21:10,614
Lord, save my friend Hecate,
even if she is the daughter of Mephisto!

255
00:21:11,341 --> 00:21:13,297
Even if she is the daughter of the devil,

256
00:21:13,341 --> 00:21:15,332
her soul is purer
than any other.

257
00:21:15,381 --> 00:21:17,337
Free her from the curse!

258
00:21:31,581 --> 00:21:35,574
Look, Hecate is opening her eyes!
Praise be to God! You're safe, Hecate!

259
00:21:36,541 --> 00:21:39,294
What are you saying? God?! But I'm in a church!

260
00:21:39,341 --> 00:21:41,730
Let me out, quick,
otherwise I'll die!

261
00:21:41,781 --> 00:21:44,170
Don't forget that I am
the daughter of Mephisto!

262
00:21:44,221 --> 00:21:46,689
But Hecate, we brought you here
to make you heal!

263
00:21:46,741 --> 00:21:50,290
Far from dying! It's here, in
church, that you have come back to life!

264
00:21:50,981 --> 00:21:55,020
God saved you because, although
the daughter of Mephisto, you have a pure soul.

265
00:21:55,061 --> 00:21:59,054
The Lord has freed you from the
curse of the evil spirit!

266
00:21:59,101 --> 00:22:02,013
It's strange that Mephisto's
daughter is being helped by God...

267
00:22:02,061 --> 00:22:04,211
..and in a church, no
less! Don't you think?

268
00:22:04,261 --> 00:22:06,821
Hecate, actually
you're an angel to us!

269
00:22:06,861 --> 00:22:09,011
Hecate!

270
00:22:09,061 --> 00:22:11,017
Mom and Dad are looking for me!

271
00:22:11,301 --> 00:22:13,861
- Hecate!
- Hecate!

272
00:22:16,301 --> 00:22:19,293
Hecate!

273
00:22:20,141 --> 00:22:23,213
Hecate, we beg you!
Come home!

274
00:22:23,541 --> 00:22:27,500
We got our sight back!
Don't worry!

275
00:22:27,661 --> 00:22:31,176
We apologized to the evil
spirit and to the Great Devil!

276
00:22:31,221 --> 00:22:34,930
- Everything is fine now!
- We won't be mean to you anymore!

277
00:22:34,981 --> 00:22:37,779
Please, come home!

278
00:22:37,821 --> 00:22:41,097
- Hecate!
- Hecate!

279
00:22:41,901 --> 00:22:44,176
Mom and Dad worry about me

280
00:22:44,221 --> 00:22:47,213
- Do you want to return, Hecate?
- Thank you so much, Hecate.

281
00:22:48,501 --> 00:22:50,332
Hail Mephisto!

282
00:22:54,181 --> 00:22:56,092
Goodbye, friends!

283
00:22:56,621 --> 00:22:59,294
Goodbye, Hecate! Goodbye!

284
00:23:03,181 --> 00:23:05,411
- Sapphire.
- Yes, Franz?

285
